# Repository workflow

Read the root `AGENTS.md` before editing or reviewing code. Use
`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md` for setup, focused validation, and browser cleanup.
Keep durable repository guidance in those files rather than duplicating it here.

For changes with observable runtime effects, exercise the affected behavior after
implementation, inspect the result, and check for browser errors. Use connected
IronBee DevTools when available; otherwise use the repository's Playwright tests
or an available browser tool. IronBee is optional and is not a project dependency.
Docs, CI configuration, and tooling-only changes need their relevant checks rather
than an unrelated UI run. Never leave browsers or servers you started running.
